      <h2>How Much Does a Gold Wash Plant Cost?</h2>
      <p>One of the most common questions we get: "How much does a gold wash plant cost?" The answer depends on several factors, but this guide will give you a clear understanding of pricing in 2026.</p>
      
      <h3>Price Ranges by Capacity</h3>
      <p>Gold wash plant prices scale with capacity. Here's a general overview:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong><a href='/products/50-ton'>50 Ton Wash Plant</a>:</strong> Entry-level pricing. Best for small operations and claim testing.</li>
        <li><strong><a href='/products/100-ton'>100 Ton Wash Plant</a>:</strong> Mid-range pricing. Versatile workhorse — best value for serious miners.</li>
        <li><strong><a href='/products/200-ton'>200 Ton Wash Plant</a>:</strong> Commercial pricing. For high-volume operations.</li>
        <li><strong><a href='/products/300-ton'>300 Ton Wash Plant</a>:</strong> Industrial pricing. Maximum production capacity.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For exact pricing on any model, <a href='/contact'>request a free custom quote</a>.</p>
      
      <h3>What Affects the Price?</h3>
      <p>Several factors determine the final cost of your wash plant:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Capacity (TPH):</strong> Larger plants cost more due to more material and engineering</li>
        <li><strong>Sluice length:</strong> Longer sluices capture more fine gold but add cost</li>
        <li><strong>Custom features:</strong> Special configurations, extra sluice runs, or modified hoppers</li>
        <li><strong>Power source:</strong> Diesel vs electric options</li>
        <li><strong>Shipping destination:</strong> Continental US shipping is free; international adds container costs</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3>Total Cost of Ownership</h3>
      <p>Beyond the purchase price, consider:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Fuel costs:</strong> Diesel consumption varies by model size</li>
        <li><strong>Water pump:</strong> You may need a separate water pump if you don't have gravity-fed water</li>
        <li><strong>Maintenance:</strong> Minimal — mostly screen replacement and occasional bearing service</li>
        <li><strong>Transport:</strong> Moving between claims requires a truck or trailer</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3>ROI: How Fast Does It Pay for Itself?</h3>
      <p>Most of our customers report their wash plant pays for itself within the first mining season. With 95-98% recovery rates, you're capturing gold that lower-quality equipment misses. Even a modest increase in recovery can mean thousands of extra dollars per season.</p>
      
      <h3>Financing Options</h3>
      <p>We understand that mining equipment is a significant investment. Contact our sales team to discuss payment plans and financing options for your operation.</p>
      
      <p><strong>Get an exact quote:</strong> Every wash plant is custom-built, so pricing depends on your specific needs. <a href='/contact'>Contact us for a free quote</a> — we'll recommend the right equipment and give you exact pricing.</p>
